      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the Oakmont estate, you'll want to evoke timeless elegance and exclusivity, something that speaks to established wealth. Imagine a sanctuary where tradition reigns supreme, a private haven perfectly suited for those who appreciate old-world grandeur and discreet prestige. This is where legacy is built, far from the noise of the modern world.\n\nFor the East River penthouse, focus on the vibrant energy and cosmopolitan pulse of the city. This is for the modern sophisticate who thrives on culture and dynamism, a perch overlooking the very heart of urban excitement. Experience life at the nexus of trendsetting culture and unparalleled city views.",
      "source": "target",
